category: Libs
requires: libcivetweb-cpp1.16.0 pkg-config
sdesc: "Embedded C/C++ web server (development / c++)"
ldesc: "Project mission is to provide easy to use, powerful, C (C/C++) embeddable web
server with optional CGI, SSL and Lua support. CivetWeb has a MIT license so
you can innovate without restrictions."
external-source: civetweb

